听到**雪白被褥摩擦的微小窸窣声**，秦海一猛地睁开眼。

当他看清她正在做什么时，瞳孔骤然紧缩。她那么虚弱，体重轻得连床垫都压不出多少弧度，连呼吸都仿佛要耗尽全力，却还在小心翼翼地往旁边挪动，试图在那张逼仄的单人病床上，为他腾出一个可以躺下的位置。

*她不仅没有推开他，甚至在试图安抚他这个差点害死她的罪魁祸首。*

~~他恨不得立刻翻身上床，将她死死锁进怀里。~~ 但在理智回笼的瞬间，巨大的恐慌先一步攫住了他。

“别动。”秦海一低哑地出声制止，声音压得很低，却透着掩饰不住的急切。他迅速直起身，大掌悬空护在她身侧，生怕她牵扯到腹部还没长好的吻合口，或者扯到手背上那根细细的**输液管**。

他深吸了一口气，将那股几乎要冲破胸腔的酸涩死死压下去，眼底的猩红更重了几分。

“床太窄了，我上去会挤到你。你身上还有伤，万一我压到你……”他连想都不敢想那个后果，喉结艰难地滚动着，语气放得很轻、很柔，带着几分哄劝的意味，“你乖乖躺好，别折腾自己。”

他没有上床，而是直接屈起长腿，席地坐了下来，背靠着**冰冷的金属护栏**。这个姿势让他能将上半身完全趴伏在她的床沿，脸颊距离她的枕头只有不到半寸的距离。

他隔着被子，轻轻拍了拍她刚才空出来的那一点点位置，算是收下了她的心意。

“我不累，就在这里陪你。”他侧过脸，视线贪婪地描摹着她苍白的侧脸，声音里带着一种尘埃落定的安稳，像是在对她承诺，又像是在说服自己，“你闭上眼睛睡一会儿，我就在旁边看着你。等你这瓶点滴打完了，我叫护士进来拔针，好不好？”

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
   <meta charset="UTF-8">
   <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
   <title>Status Bar v8</title>
   <style>
       * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

       body {
           background: #0d0d1a;
           min-height: 100vh;
           display: flex;
           justify-content: center;
           align-items: center;
           font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
           padding: 20px;
       }

       .main-container {
           display: flex;
           flex-direction: column;
           gap: 20px;
           max-width: 500px;
       }

       .container {
           display: flex;
           align-items: center;
           gap: 25px;
           background: #1a1a2e;
           padding: 20px 24px;
           border: 2px solid #333;
           border-radius: 8px;
       }

       .status-panel {
           display: flex;
           flex-direction: column;
           justify-content: space-between;
           min-width: 180px;
           height: 90px;
       }

       .stat-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
       .stat-label { color: #888; font-size: 11px; width: 55px; }
       .stat-bar { flex: 1; height: 14px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
       .stat-fill { height: 100%; transition: width 0.3s; }
       .stat-fill.lust { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff6b9d, #ff3366); }
       .stat-fill.semen { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #aaddff, #eeffff); }
       .stat-fill.threshold { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffaa00, #ff5500); }
       .stat-value { color: #aaa; font-size: 10px; width: 30px; text-align: right; }

       .mini-stage { position: relative; width: 60px; height: 100px; overflow: visible; }

       .p { width: 6px; height: 6px; image-rendering: pixelated; }
       .skin { background: #e8b8c0; }
       .skin-d { background: #d49aa5; }
       .skin-l { background: #f5d0d8; }
       .head-c { background: #e0909a; }
       .head-d { background: #c87885; }
       .head-l { background: #f0a8b5; }
       .vein { background: #c090a0; }
       .ball { background: #d4a0a8; }
       .ball-d { background: #b88890; }

       .row { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
       .base { position: absolute; bottom: 5px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }

       .dick {
           position: absolute;
           bottom: 17px;
           left: 50%;
           display: flex;
           flex-direction: column;
           align-items: center;
           transform-origin: bottom center;
           transition: transform 0.5s, filter 0.5s;
       }

       .dick.soft { transform: translateX(-50%) scaleY(0.7) scaleX(0.85); filter: brightness(0.95); }
       .dick.rising { transform: translateX(-50%) scaleY(0.85) scaleX(0.92); filter: brightness(0.98); }
       .dick.hard { transform: translateX(-50%) scaleY(1) scaleX(1); filter: brightness(1); }

       .cum-container {
           position: absolute;
           bottom: 95px;
           left: 50%;
           transform: translateX(-50%);
           width: 70px;
           height: 35px;
           pointer-events: none;
           overflow: visible;
       }

       .cum-pixel {
           position: absolute;
           background: #fff;
           box-shadow: 0 0 3px #fff;
           border-radius: 50%;
           opacity: 0;
       }

       .c1 { width: 5px; height: 3px; }
       .c2 { width: 4px; height: 2px; }
       .c3 { width: 4px; height: 2px; }
       .c4 { width: 4px; height: 2px; }
       .c5 { width: 3px; height: 2px; }
       .c6 { width: 4px; height: 2px; }

       .cumming .c1 { animation: cumU 1s ease-out forwards; }
       .cumming .c2 { animation: cumLU 1s ease-out 0.04s forwards; }
       .cumming .c3 { animation: cumRU 1s ease-out 0.04s forwards; }
       .cumming .c4 { animation: cumL 1s ease-out 0.08s forwards; }
       .cumming .c5 { animation: cumR 1s ease-out 0.08s forwards; }
       .cumming .c6 { animation: cumU2 1s ease-out 0.06s forwards; }

       @keyframes cumU {
           0% { opacity: 0; left: 35px; top: 33px; transform: scale(0); }
           8% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); }
           100% { opacity: 0; left: 34px; top: 2px; transform: scale(0.3); }
       }
       @keyframes cumU2 {
           0% { opacity: 0; left: 35px; top: 33px; transform: scale(0); }
           10% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
           100% { opacity: 0; left: 36px; top: 6px; transform: scale(0.35); }
       }
       @keyframes cumLU {
           0% { opacity: 0; left: 35px; top: 33px; transform: scale(0); }
           8% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
           100% { opacity: 0; left: 8px; top: 8px; transform: scale(0.25); }
       }
       @keyframes cumRU {
           0% { opacity: 0; left: 35px; top: 33px; transform: scale(0); }
           8% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
           100% { opacity: 0; left: 58px; top: 8px; transform: scale(0.25); }
       }
       @keyframes cumL {
           0% { opacity: 0; left: 35px; top: 33px; transform: scale(0); }
           8% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(0.8); }
           100% { opacity: 0; left: 5px; top: 20px; transform: scale(0.2); }
       }
       @keyframes cumR {
           0% { opacity: 0; left: 35px; top: 33px; transform: scale(0); }
           8% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(0.8); }
           100% { opacity: 0; left: 62px; top: 20px; transform: scale(0.2); }
       }

       .dream-warning {
           color: #ff6b9d;
           font-size: 9px;
           opacity: 0;
           transition: opacity 0.3s;
           text-align: center;
       }
       .dream-warning.active { opacity: 1; animation: pulse 1s infinite; }
       @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.5; } }

       .rules-panel {
           background: #1a1a2e;
           border: 2px solid #333;
           border-radius: 8px;
           padding: 16px 20px;
       }

       .rules-title {
           color: #aaa;
           font-size: 12px;
           margin-bottom: 12px;
           border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
           padding-bottom: 8px;
       }

       .rule-section { margin-bottom: 12px; }
       .rule-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
       .rule-header { color: #ff6b9d; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 6px; }

       .rule-list { list-style: none; padding-left: 10px; }
       .rule-list li {
           color: #666;
           font-size: 10px;
           margin-bottom: 4px;
           position: relative;
           padding-left: 12px;
       }
       .rule-list li::before { content: '›'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #444; }
       .rule-list .highlight { color: #aaa; }
       .rule-list .num { color: #ffaa00; }
       .rule-list .trigger { color: #ff5500; }
       .rule-list .effect { color: #88ccff; }
   </style>
</head>
<body>
